</ol>
<p>The sound of water is one of the most harmonious melodies that exist, and it is used as a therapy to control problems such as insomnia. So having a small <a href="/indoor-water-fountains/">water fountain design</a> indoor at home can be ideal for creating a calm environment in which balance reigns. You just have to make sure that the engine&#8217;s sound does not cover the sound of the water jump.</p>
<ol start="3">
