</ol>
<p>Negative ions are highly beneficial for the body&#8217;s health. They are mainly found in places where water is in motion, such as the sea that collides with rocks, waterfalls, and waterfalls.</p>
<p>When crashing, water expands the charge of negative ions in small particles, which stimulate the growth and proliferation of cells, helping them to renew themselves more quickly and have a balance in the nervous, sympathetic and parasympathetic systems, which produces a feeling of well-being.</p>
<ol start="4">
<li><strong>Energy</strong></li>
</ol>
<p>By feeling a more relaxed environment, without strain, it is possible that we can enjoy better energy to be productive.So it is recommended to place the water fountain design indoor in spaces of the house such as the living room or on the desk where it is work or study.</p>
